# Manifold level 2
# Surfaces (stage 3b): what a floor is made of, and a zone that carries; and how it sounds (stage 3f). An ice rink, where the
# character's feet push a twelfth of what they push on stone: it slides, and it takes that much longer
# to stop. Then a stream across the way: a current that carries whoever stands in it towards the edge.
title Surfaces
spawn 0 1 9
facing 0 0 -1

# The start, in three floors that sound different under the feet (stage 3f): wood on the left, stone in
# the middle (as every box that says nothing), metal on the right.
box -2.75 -0.5 8  1.25 0.5 3  material wood  color #8a6a42  name start_wood
box 0 -0.5 8      1.5 0.5 3   color #6f6a62  name start
box 2.75 -0.5 8   1.25 0.5 3  material metal  color #7a7e84  name start_metal

# The rink: ice, 12 m long. Three posts of stone on it, to slide into (or around).
box 0 -0.5 -1     4 0.5 6     material ice  color #c8dde6  name rink
box -2 0.6 0      0.3 0.6 0.3  color #5a4a38
box 2 0.6 -2      0.3 0.6 0.3  color #5a4a38
box 0 0.6 -4.5    0.3 0.6 0.3  color #5a4a38

# Stone again, with a checkpoint; the stream, 4 m wide, whose current carries 3 m/s to the right
# whoever stands in it (not a jump over it: it takes hold through the feet), as deep as a character
# wading in it reaches with its center (a zone notices a center), and on past the edge: it carries,
# it does not push, so ending at the edge it would leave whoever it carried standing there. And the
# far side, with the goal. Walking at 4.5 m/s, to cross it straight a character walks upstream, a
# little to the left; or it jumps over it.
box 0 -0.5 -8.5   4 0.5 1.5   color #6f6a62
box 0 -0.5 -12    4 0.5 2     color #3d6a8a  name stream_bed
box 0 -0.5 -16    4 0.5 2     color #6f6a62  name far_side
sensor current     2 0.5 -12    6 0.5 2      flow 3 0 0  name stream
sensor checkpoint  0 0.8 -8.5   3.5 0.8 1.2
sensor goal        0 0.8 -16.5  3 0.8 1.2

# The void under it all.
sensor fall        0 -6 -4      30 3 30
